                "caption": "Figure 1:Overview of representative tasks in our benchmark.VGI-Benchadopts adouble-level taxonomy: the first level groups every task into one of four mutually exclusive taskdomains,\nwhile the second level annotates each task with one or more (non-exclusive)skill tags, as shown in the legend at the bottom. Each panel shows a representative real-scene input image; the icons under the task name encode that task’s skill tags.",
